                <mxCell id="l3-imputer-inner" value="&lt;b&gt;Pipeline Orchestrator&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━&lt;br&gt;• Owns model, processor, preprocessed inputs&lt;br&gt;• Manages batching and device placement&lt;br&gt;• Coordinates: &lt;b&gt;Segmenter → Masker → Model Forward → Extract&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;i&gt;forward_1d(coalitions)&lt;/i&gt; → diagonal logits (N,)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;i&gt;forward_crossmodal(img_coal, txt_coal)&lt;/i&gt; → full matrix (Nᵢ×Nₜ)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f0fe;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
